/www.animeunity.co/anime/7180-hell-teacher-jigoku-sensei-nube-2025-ita","image":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/bx179678-1isykDVghv8Q.png"}]},{"title":"Hell Teacher: Jigoku Sensei Nube (2025) Part 2","link":"https://www.animeunity.co/anime/7261-hell-teacher-jigoku-sensei-nube-2025-part-2","image":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/bx191967-fLWqssc0gPI4.jpg","type":"TV","year":"2026","dubStatus":"subbed","dubStatusKey":"Subbed","variants":[{"status":"subbed","statusKey":"Subbed","title":"Hell Teacher: Jigoku Sensei Nube (2025) Part 2","link":"https://www.animeunity.co/anime/7261-hell-teacher-jigoku-sensei-nube-2025-part-2","image":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/bx191967-fLWqssc0gPI4.jpg"}]}],"linkList":[{"title":"Episodes 1-13","titleKey":"Episodes {{start}}-{{end}}","titleParams":{"start":1,"end":13},"availabilityStatus":"available","episodesLink":"7261|1|13"}]},"episodes":[{"title":"Yokai dimensionale - Makuragaeshi","episodeNumber":1,"sourceEpisodeNumber":1,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19321","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"191967","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61608","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259544","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"452421","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]}],"link":"103399","synopsis":"Kyoko si sveglia una mattina, pronta per andare a scuola, ma scopre di avere 26 anni e di dovere invece andare al lavoro. In preda alla confusione, cerca di orientarsi in un mondo a lei sconosciuto, incontrando vecchie amicizie, ormai adulte come lei. Solo quando riesce a parlare con Miki, quest'ultima le svela dove si trova Nube, l'unica persona ancora in grado di aiutarla.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1LP7XKtauS2SKFiFmudaNbIBWAL.jpg"},{"title":"Nube che saltava nel tempo","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19321","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"191967","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61608","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259544","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"452421","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[15]}],"link":"103648","synopsis":"Nube incontra uno yokai che gli permette di tornare al passato per rimediare a un vecchio errore, e lì rivede Minako, la maestra esorcista che lo ha sostenuto durante le elementari e gli ha insegnato a diventare l'insegnante che è oggi. Nonostante il suo tentativo di salvarla, si rende conto di non poterlo fare, perché il passato è già avvenuto, e di doversi invece dedicare ai propri studenti.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7qq3eV9CCENGxCF31FjFPu3BDY6.jpg"},{"title":"Ritorna la yukionna","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19321","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"191967","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61608","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259544","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[16]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"452421","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[16]}],"link":"103785","synopsis":"Nube riceve un misterioso pacco refrigerato da cui esce Yukime, che ha deciso di andare a vivere con lui dopo essere stata scacciata dalla divinità dei monti su cui vive. Quando però vede Nube fare il cascamorto con Ritsuko, è presa dalla gelosia e scappa via, rimanendo però coinvolta in un incendio mentre cerca di salvare una bambina.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/peVlFlMVsh31fSkzggkzFQsQzs8.jpg"},{"title":"È arrivato A!","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19321","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"191967","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61608","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259544","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"452421","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[17]}],"link":"103995","synopsis":"Gli adulti di Domori tengono nascosto un segreto ai bambini, e cercano di mandarli a casa di tutta fretta. Miki, Hiroshi e Kyoko, però, sono curiosi e latitano per strada, diventando così le vittime del Figuro A, un misterioso individuo che prendere di mira proprio i bambini. Saranno Nube e Ritsuko a fare il possibile per proteggere i loro studenti.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8wL9Qlc9IzAnIHB7GeIq6KcXbFn.jpg"},{"title":"Daidarabocchi","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19321","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"191967","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61608","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259544","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"452421","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[18]}],"link":"104126","synopsis":"Le richieste di Miki sembrano avverarsi misteriosamente per mano di uno yokai chiamato Daidarabocchi, solo che lei è l'unica a rendersi conto dei cambiamenti che avvengono in città. Quando anche Nube e Kyoko si mostrano scettici di fronte ai suoi racconti, decide di provare che Daidarabocchi esiste veramente. Purtroppo fallisce e si mette in pericolo tentando di riportare un rondinino al nido.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y94jMcn9I8SlTqLKDJvFrRMqnfX.jpg"},{"title":"Bestia divina - Kirin","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19321","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"191967","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61608","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259544","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"452421","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[19]}],"link":"104287","synopsis":"Katsuya cerca un posto dove pescare, con l'aiuto del portafortuna regalatogli da Manami, quando però per errore uccide dei pesci e incontra una creatura misteriosa. Dopo essere fuggito, scopre che quella creatura è un kirin, e Nube lo avvisa che si tratta di una bestia divina. Decide perciò di andare a recuperare il portafortuna smarrito, temendo che il kirin decida di attaccare Manami.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/63hyYELEGoHb5yYZ4h9m1w9qTgh.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 20","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19321","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"191967","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61608","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259544","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"452421","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[20]}],"link":"105068","synopsis":"Nube, Kyoko, her friends, and even Yukime the Yuki-onna are at the beach for a day of fun. Despite melting in the scorching heat, Yukime takes every chance she gets to declare her burning love for Nube. However, Kyoko, still suspicious of Yukime, continually pours cold water on her attempts to get close to Nube. As sparks fly between the girls, a dark and sinister shadow appears in the sea.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tKzTcYoH7pdn7F5ztdTWEEIdZQO.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 21","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19321","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"191967","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61608","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259544","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"452421","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[21]}],"link":"105431","synopsis":"Mamoru is a healthy, soccer-loving fifth grader in Ms. Ritsuko's class. Or he was, until he falls ill after spotting a ghastly shadow dancing on a rooftop. Suspicious of his situation, Mamoru turns to Nube for help, which earns Ms. Ritsuko's ire. Though miffed, Mamoru would rather depend on the seemingly unreliable Nube. Ms. Ritsuko visits him in the hospital, only to witness a terrifying scene.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4IEq2Es8pXLH4kPlTJCF8q0RF1n.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 22","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19321","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"191967","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61608","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259544","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"452421","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[22]}],"link":"105730","synopsis":"An incoming storm traps Miki and Hiroshi at the empty school with Nube. They watch in confusion as a car comes screeching into the schoolyard and a man and woman leap out, desperately searching for somewhere to hide. Realizing the gravity of the situation, Nube takes action, but it may be too late. A deadly game of hide-and-seek has already begun.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8q1itgsJNPna46Qa2Z2yF9bqEhg.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 23","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19321","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"191967","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61608","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259544","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"452421","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[23]}],"link":"105852","synopsis":"When Hiroshi and his friends find a love letter addressed to Nube, their curiosity gets the better of them, and they secretly follow him to his date. Arriving at a seaside park, they see Nube with a cute girl and learn she is a former student of his. However, something about this girl does not seem quite right.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nNYEQBRh4k1fYYQGnmAzcKijPxL.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 24","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19321","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"191967","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61608","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259544","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[24]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"452421","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[24]}],"link":"105943","synopsis":"Every grade school student in Japan knows about the evil spirit Miss Mary. Once she hands you her cursed doll, you have just one week to find its missing arms and legs. If you fail, she will pull off your own limbs to make her doll whole again. When Noriko becomes her next target, Nube vows to protect her. However, his determination to exorcise Miss Mary wavers when he learns of her tragic past.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zCwgqJeTkteMVDZjkIWhU6Nf75n.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 25","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19321","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"191967","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61608","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259544","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[25]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"452421","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[25]}],"link":"106081","synopsis":"The Demon Hand begins to break free from its seal on Nube's Day of Annihilation, the one day when his psychic powers are at their weakest. Without the seal, Nube's body and soul will fall completely under the demon's control. When Tamamo realizes the danger, he dives into Nube's memories to find a way to reseal the demon. However, nothing can prepare him for the shock he is about to face.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7uRtDKJdoaxMwr1WFszScHERchX.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 26","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19321","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"191967","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61608","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259544","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[26]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"452421","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[26]}],"link":"106102","synopsis":"As Nube struggles against a demon far more powerful than himself, it becomes clear he cannot defeat it alone. If he dies here, the Nube that Hiroshi knows will cease to exist. However, Hiroshi and his friends can only watch in bewilderment. Despite the odds, Nube refuses to give up. He prepares for the worst when suddenly, he senses something strangely familiar.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1mit4aHiusW7oV53h3QIfay2q4r.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":191967,"malId":61608},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-28T07:48:11Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:191967","mal:61608"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18767","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"19321","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"179678"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"191967","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"59342"},{"provider":"mal","id":"61608","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"259544","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-13":"14-26"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"452421","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-13":"14-26"}}]},"sourceMetadata":{"info":{"id":7261,"title":"Jigoku Sensei Nube (2025) Part 